      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"197 characters\">Choosing handmade jewellery is a vote for slow making, for skill, and for the idea that beauty is worth taking time over.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
