    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>long_description</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">What does it truly mean to wear something of real value?&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Value is not just the weight of metal. It lives in the hours a craftsperson spends laying a single kundan stone into its lac setting &amp;mdash; in the invisible thread between maker and wearer that no machine can manufacture. At 8thniq Jewells, we built everything on this conviction. We are the first atelier in the world to bring jadau jewellery into silver, paired with the rare luminosity of glass meenakari.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">01Handcrafted vs Machine-Made&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">What no machine can replicate&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">A machine stamps and repeats &amp;mdash; flawlessly, indifferently. Ten thousand identical pieces, without pause. That precision is also its limitation: perfection in the mechanical sense is sameness.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">An artisan&amp;#39;s hand carries memory. Years of practice train the fingers to feel the resistance of silver, to know when pressure should yield. Every handcrafted piece bears the quiet imprint of that knowledge &amp;mdash; a micro-variation, a brushstroke of texture &amp;mdash; that makes it genuinely, irreducibly one of a kind.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">8thniq in Practice&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Our silver jadau artisans press every setting by hand into lac, placing each stone with a tool no wider than a few millimetres. A single necklace can take weeks to complete.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">02&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">The Jadau Tradition &amp;mdash; Now in Silver&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">A first in Indian craft history&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Jadau jewellery originated in the Mughal courts of Rajasthan. Gemstones are not prong-set but pressed directly into a lac base, held purely by the skilled manipulation of surrounding metal. It passes from master to apprentice over years of silent, watchful repetition &amp;mdash; it cannot be learned from a manual.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Jadau has always been done in gold. 8thniq Jewells is the first brand in the world to craft authentic jadau entirely in silver &amp;mdash; rooted in ancient Indian heritage, reimagined for the contemporary luxury buyer.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&amp;quot;When you wear jadau, you wear the accumulated knowledge of generations. A machine cannot inherit that lineage &amp;mdash; it can only approximate its appearance.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&amp;mdash; 8thniq Jewells, The World&amp;#39;s First Silver Jadau Atelier&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">03&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Glass Meenakari &amp;mdash; India&amp;#39;s Rarest Jewellery Art&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Colour that breathes, not just sits&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Conventional meenakari uses powdered enamel fused by kiln heat. Glass meenakari is different &amp;mdash; fine glass laid directly onto metal produces a translucency and depth of colour that enamel cannot rival. Light moves through it, not just off it. Few artisans in the world still practise this technique. At 8thniq, every piece that carries glass meenakari is also an act of preservation.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFE0;&quot;&gt;I Time Invested&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Hours, days, sometimes weeks of focused human effort &amp;mdash; irreplaceable, and alive in the object forever.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFFF00;&quot;&gt;II Unique Identity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">No two handcrafted pieces are the same. Variation is not imperfection &amp;mdash; it is the signature of a living hand.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFD700;&quot;&gt;III Heirloom Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Built to last generations. Made to be passed down, not discarded.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#DAA520;&quot;&gt;IV&amp;nbsp; Cultural Memory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Every piece is a carrier of tradition &amp;mdash; connecting you to centuries of Indian craft heritage.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">04:The True Cost of Machine-Made Jewellery&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">What is silently lost&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Fast jewellery follows fast fashion toward early obsolescence. Its cost is low because its life expectancy is low &amp;mdash; and because, gradually and invisibly, it makes a world where artisans who know how to create something truly beautiful have no livelihood to sustain them.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">Choosing handmade jewellery is a vote for slow making, for skill, and for the idea that beauty is worth taking time over.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">The hand has not been surpassed. It has only been forgotten.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">At 8thniq Jewells, we are here to remember it &amp;mdash; one silver jadau piece at a time.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4321 characters\">&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
